    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/extras/88cd6807bb480dc61dd00f9b580cc082.avif?t=1745521207\" width=668 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/extras/c6ad3e376d941d24f7f18f300cb2142d.avif?t=1745521207\" width=600 height=80 /></span><strong>Zila</strong> the Warlock, a mythical and infamous witch, has been released from her eternal prison and has made almost every hero of the Royal Kingdom vanish! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desperate attempt to retrieve its missing heroes and stop Zila, the Savers Guild hires you as their new Remote Coordinator\u2122! Your job will be to find and recruit heroes, lead them through quests and battles, and manage your party\u2019s funds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/extras/064f0dc31cf4ab1b5b9428dd44fbdfea.avif?t=1745521207\" width=600 height=80 /></span>Discover the world of <i>Born of Bread</i> for the first time or dive back in with this roguelite deckbuilder! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your new job as a Remote Coordinator\u2122 by choosing one hero from your pool of unlocked heroes and assigning them as the leader of your party. Each one has a passive leader ability and their own set of cards, representing their attacks, defensive maneuvers, and special moves. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/extras/88cd6807bb480dc61dd00f9b580cc082.avif?t=1745521207\" width=668 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/extras/c6ad3e376d941d24f7f18f300cb2142d.avif?t=1745521207\" width=600 height=80 /></span><strong>Zila</strong> the Warlock, a mythical and infamous witch, has been released from her eternal prison and has made almost every hero of the Royal Kingdom vanish! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desperate attempt to retrieve its missing heroes and stop Zila, the Savers Guild hires you as their new Remote Coordinator\u2122! Your job will be to find and recruit heroes, lead them through quests and battles, and manage your party\u2019s funds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/extras/064f0dc31cf4ab1b5b9428dd44fbdfea.avif?t=1745521207\" width=600 height=80 /></span>Discover the world of <i>Born of Bread</i> for the first time or dive back in with this roguelite deckbuilder! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your new job as a Remote Coordinator\u2122 by choosing one hero from your pool of unlocked heroes and assigning them as the leader of your party. Each one has a passive leader ability and their own set of cards, representing their attacks, defensive maneuvers, and special moves. </p>",
    "short_description": "Dip your pen in the company ink with this roguelite card-based adventure game! Find heroes, assemble a powerful party, and get ready to fill your weekdays with battles and quests!",
